            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo chitö nyï ngwïno kanasyanta Posra ompö koro Edom? Ngo nyinte nyï loköy sïro cho pïchighöch, cho pïröch, mi kukelu ompö wowïnto owesyenyi? Ani ECHOTYON nyete, nyo otïng owesyö osörï.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
